"""Editorial "In order" guides: which order to watch, read and play a franchise in.

Content only; app/in_order.py and app/routers/in_order.py turn it into pages.
Franchises were chosen from the ones people most often search "... in order" for,
and lean toward stories told across several formats, which is what OmniTrackr tracks.

Entry fields: id (unique within the guide), kind (title_pages.KINDS key), title (as the
metadata sources usually spell it, so members' copies match), year, creator (director,
author or artist; None for TV, anime and games), aka (other titles members may have saved
it under), note (what it is and why it sits where it does), optional (a side story the
guide does not count toward finishing the franchise).

Orders: the first is the one the guide recommends. "ids" lists entry ids in that order;
"pitch" says who the order suits.
"""

